     "<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Error</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">in</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> sim</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1000</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> mod</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> n </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,102,102)\">200</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> generate </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lavaanfun </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;cfa&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Please</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> specify an appropriate </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">object</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> the </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;generate&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> argument</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> simsem model </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">template</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lavaan script</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lavaan parameter table</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,0,102)\">OpenMx</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">object</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">a list of options </span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">for</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> the </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;simulateData&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">or</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> a </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> that takes sample size </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">and</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> provides data </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,136)\">as</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> an output</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>Any help would be much appreciated!</div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>The error message seems pretty clear, and you can find information about those different &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">generate</font>&quot; methods on the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> ?sim </font>help page.  For instance, if you want to use the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> simulateData() </font>function, instead of calling that function with the arguments, you can save the list of arguments to pass to the &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">generate</font>&quot; argument:</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">simArgs &lt;- list(model = popModel, sample.nobs = 200, skewness = 1.5, kurtosis = 6)</font></div></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Output1 &lt;- </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">sim(..., </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">generate = simArgs)</font> </blockquote><div><br></div><div>You should exclude the &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">seed</font>&quot; argument because that would mean all 1000 replications would generate the same data set.  Instead, you should use the &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">seed</font>&quot; argument in the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> sim() </font>function.  Also, notice the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> ?sim </font>help page says you can specify the distributions of indicators using the &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">indDist</font>&quot; argument, so you could also specify the skew/kurtosis using the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> bindDist() </font>function.</div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div>UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427991133000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20igwGTKrOk9Wy1RVwxxfi\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div></div><div><br></div>"
